Description: PostgreSQL proxy, pooler, load balancer, sharder and query router
 PgDog is a PostgreSQL proxy, pooler, load balancer, sharder and query router
 written in Rust. Version 0.1.56 uses the new parser and plugin ABI 0.4;
 custom 0.1.32 plugins must be rebuilt and manual query fingerprints retired.
 .
 This package ships the PgDog daemon, a systemd service unit, and default
 configuration templates.
